 "No clocks, no rush": "help:accessibility",
 "Nothing in OutBrick depends on sound. Friends talk in text bubbles, and Haptics let you feel moves land.": "help:accessibility",
 "Off": "help:accessibility",
 "On": "help:accessibility · help:settings",
