 "Puts the chosen piece down. Outside the board, closes Settings and cards.": "help:voice-control-switch-control-keyboard",
 "Read [Playing with VoiceOver](help:voiceover). Keep **Announcement detail** on Standard to begin with, and try **Row sound** to scan a row by ear.": "help:accessibility",
 "Read [Voice Control, Switch Control and keyboards](help:voice-control-switch-control-keyboard).": "help:accessibility",
