 "Swipe up or down to hear its actions, such as “Slide left, out through the red gate”, “Slide up to the end, 3 cells” or “Swap up with blue brick”. Working swaps come first; a swap that would make nothing says “no match”.": "help:voiceover",
 "Swipe with three fingers to move a village at a time.": "help:voiceover",
 "Switch Control is treated like VoiceOver on the board: every piece is its own element, in reading order, and the same direction controls appear. Turn on **Hold to confirm swaps** if you scan quickly.": "help:voice-control-switch-control-keyboard",
 "Switch Control on the Slide & Match boards has been built and checked in code but not yet played end to end on a device by the team. If you play with switches, we would love to hear how it goes in the [Accessibility category](/community/c/accessibility).": "help:voice-control-switch-control-keyboard",
 "Switch Control on the Slide & Match boards.": "help:accessibility",
