 "Tell us the level, the piece and the exact words VoiceOver said in the [Accessibility category](/community/c/accessibility), or use **Settings › Report a bug** in the game.": "help:voiceover",
 "Tell us when something gets in your way": "help:accessibility",
 "Text grows up to the largest accessibility size, and layouts stack so nothing is cut off. The board header and tray support the Large Content Viewer: touch and hold to see a magnified label.": "help:accessibility",
 "The Accessibility tab, top to bottom": "help:accessibility",
 "The Animation speed choices answer to either the percentage or the word: “Half speed”, “Slower”, “Normal speed”, “Faster”, “Double speed”.": "help:voice-control-switch-control-keyboard",
